# Threadfin for a Plex on another computer or outside Docker (docs/plex.md).
# title: Threadfin for your Plex
# needs: A Plex you already run, on this computer or another.
# asks: A playlist named plex, made on the Dashboard; and your Plex's address and a token (KIA_PLEX_URL, KIA_PLEX_TOKEN), so kia can add its tuners to it.
# order: 4
KIA_STACK=plex-tuner
